Zynthoro - Evidence File
Zynthoro began as a concept and planning-stage project at the start of the Build With Gemini XPRIZE hackathon period.
Since then, active development has progressed: a functional prototype website has been built using the Emergent platform, including a homepage, core navigation, authentication, dashboard, and AI assistant integration powered by the Claude API.
Zynthoro has also been selected for Anthropic's Claude for Startups program, providing additional API credits and support to accelerate development.
This repository documents that progression — from initial concept to a working prototype — as part of the Build With Gemini XPRIZE submission.
Public-facing prototype: zynthoro.ai (presale opens June 22, 2026; public launch June 30, 2026)
Further development, including full ERP module rollout, will continue throughout the remainder of the hackathon period.
– MyRootzz (Zynthoro project owner)
